# Hidden files and directories are excluded by default, at every depth.
# Add only verified build inputs here. Reopen parents before their files.
**/.*
!.editorconfig
!**/wwwroot/**/.vite
**/wwwroot/**/.vite/*
!**/wwwroot/**/.vite/manifest.json

# Whitelisting a folder permits its contents unless another rule excludes them.
# Keep exceptions narrow. Shared Git configuration is not automatically a build input.
# Non-hidden build output and credential files use the exclusions below.

# Repository license
LICENSE

# Dependencies and build output
**/node_modules
**/npm-debug.log
**/obj
**/bin
**/out
**/build

# Editor and local tooling state
**/*.*proj.user
**/*.dbmdl
**/*.jfm

# Deployment and environment configuration
**/azds.yaml
**/charts
**/*.env
# Exclude environment-specific configuration regardless of its environment name.
**/secrets.*.yaml
**/values.*.yaml

# Container build definitions
**/docker-compose*
**/Dockerfile*

# Documentation, except analyzer release metadata required by the build
**/*.md

# Preserve explicit build-input exceptions
!src/**/*.cs
!**/*.csproj
!**/*.sln
!**/*.slnx
!**/NuGet.Config
!global.json
!Directory.Build.props
!**/AnalyzerReleases.Shipped.md
!**/AnalyzerReleases.Unshipped.md

# Local credentials and private keys must not enter a build context.
**/AppData/Roaming/gcloud
**/AppData/Roaming/terraform.d
**/kubeconfig
**/kubeconfig.*
**/*.kubeconfig
**/*.key
**/*.keys
**/*.priv
**/*.rsa
**/*.key.json
**/*.ssh
**/*.ssh-key
**/*.pfx

# Research documentation
paper/

# Generated build, test, and analysis output.
**/artifacts
**/BenchmarkDotNet.Artifacts
**/*.binlog
**/*.trx
**/TestResults
**/coverage*.json
**/coverage*.xml
**/coverage*.info
**/*.coverage
**/*.coveragexml
trivy-results.sarif
